      "description": "FURNISHED ONE BEDROOM APARTMENT WITH ACCESS TO THE BEST OF RICHMOND AT YOUR DOOR!<br/> Pets on Application <br/> <br/>Freshly painted with new carpets and fittings, this bright and comfortable second level apartment is not to be missed. Offering the best of inner-city living, this apartment is a stone’s throw from some of Melbourne's best cafes and restaurants, walking distance to the MCG and parks and just metres away from public transport. <br/><br/> Featuring:<br/><br/>- A private north-facing balcony<br/>- Modern open plan kitchen with stainless steel appliances<br/>- Master bedroom with built in robes<br/>- Sparkling bathroom<br/>- European laundry<br/>- Reverse cycle heating/cooling<br/>- Security entrance <br/><br/>REGISTRATION REQUIRED TO INSPECT. Please ensure you click ENQUIRE NOW to be sent the registration email. Once you have registered your interest you will be notified of any changes. <br/>VIEW TIMES are displayed on this page. View times are subject to cancellation/change until 12pm on the day of open. We advise you check the listing on the day, to ensure property still available prior to inspection to avoid disappointment. <br/>APPLYING - Apply online via 1FORM by clicking the link on advert. <br/>LEASE TERMS - 12 MTHS unless otherwise specified.<br/>Only if 'KEY IN OFFICE' is displayed in the advert HEADING, the property is available for inspection by collecting the keys from our office. Terms and conditions apply.  <br/>PARKING PERMITS - Whilst parking permits are available for most properties, please confirm with the local council before applying for the property. <br/>PHOTO ID MUST BE PROVIDED BEFORE ENTRY AT THE PROPERTY OR IN THE OFFICE WHEN COLLECTING KEYS<br/>GUARANTEED RESPONSE WITHIN 1 BUSINESS DAY (Conditions Apply)<br/><br/>BIGGIN SCOTT RICHMOND - NO 1 FOR PROPERTY MANAGEMENT<br/><br/>    ",
